{"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/minimumCut(capacity:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"A global minimum cut over ","type":"text"},{"code":"directedView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", or nil below two vertices.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows","doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5FlowsE10minimumCut8capacityAD0E0VyAA12DirectedViewVyxGqd__GSgqd__5Edges_5IndexQZXE_ts18AdditiveArithmeticRd__SLRd__lF","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"Flows","relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"]}],"title":"minimumCut(capacity:)","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Flows\/GlobalMinimumCut.swift#L484","fileName":"GlobalMinimumCut.swift"},"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"minimumCut","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"capacity","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Cut","preciseIdentifier":"s:5Flows3CutV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"DirectedView","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols12DirectedViewV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">?","kind":"text"}]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/flows\/graphprotocols\/graph\/minimumcut(capacity:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"minimumCut"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"capacity"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Edges"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Index"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:5Flows3CutV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/Cut","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Cut"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols12DirectedViewV","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedView","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"DirectedView"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":">? "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s18AdditiveArithmeticP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AdditiveArithmetic"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SL","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Comparable"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The cut minimizes the capacity of the edges between a nonempty proper vertex set and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rest. The side holding the first vertex is the source side. Computed by Nagamochi–Ibaraki:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"maximum adjacency orderings that contract every edge whose scanned connection is at least"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the best cut so far. Which minimum cut is returned when several exist is unspecified, but"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same input always gives the same cut."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When the edges of positive capacity do not connect the graph, the result is the cut of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value zero whose source side is the first vertex’s component, with every crossing edge."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Parallel capacities add and self-loops are ignored. "},{"code":"capacity","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is called once per non-loop"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"edge, in position order, before any work."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sums are formed in a wider type than "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"C"},{"type":"text","text":" where needed ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int128"},{"type":"text","text":" for fixed-width"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"integers, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Double"},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Float"},{"type":"text","text":"), so a contracted group’s connection may exceed "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"C"},{"type":"text","text":"’s range."}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(nm log n) in the worst case.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Complexity","type":"aside","style":"note"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every capacity is at least zero, not NaN and finite, and the minimum cut’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value fits in "},{"code":"C","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (it is at most every vertex’s capacity sum)."}]}],"name":"Precondition","type":"aside","style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://Flows/documentation/Flows/Cut":{"title":"Cut","abstract":[{"text":"The vertices split into a source side and a sink side, and the edges from the first to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"second. Returned by ","type":"text"},{"code":"minimumCut(from:to:capacity:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"minimumCut(capacity:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Flow.minimumCut","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Cut"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/Cut","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/flows\/cut","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Cut"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://Flows/documentation/Flows/GraphProtocols/Graph/minimumCut(capacity:)":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"minimumCut"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"capacity","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","text":"Edges","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text"